      "innerText": "®\nREGISTERED TRADEMARK\nIntroducing the\nLabon®\n\nWe took everything you love about an Indian laddoo - the warmth, the richness, the nostalgia and wrapped it in the precision of a French bonbon shell. Labon® is where Indian mithai craftsmanship meets European flavour sensibility, layered and handcrafted at THF.\n\nSix Artisanal Flavours - From Pistachio & Hazelnut to French Cranberry & White Chocolate\n",
